**Rastreshani** (/' *rɑstrɛʃani* /) or colloquially **Nasuuhii** (/' *nasu:hi:* /, *[[rastreshani|Rastreshani]]*: ᓇᓱᕵ ) is a language spoken in the area of [[rastreshan|Rastreshan]] and [[siiter|Siiter]].

